<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Synthelabo.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Synthelabo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA in New York, Frankfurt branch, has issued 2.6 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Synthelabo SA, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS.</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   07.APR.97	    SPOT REFERENCE 590 FRF</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		  MIN EXER LOT   1000</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	STRIKE    PRICE     MATURITY     PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	625 FRF   11.40 FRF 07.APR.98    19.32 PCT  5.2 X</p>
<p> CALL	725 FRF   14.40 FRF 07.APR.99    24.41 PCT  4.1 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
